Package: actual-bank-sync
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: adduser, ca-certificates, cron, logrotate, nodejs (>= 22), util-linux
Maintainer: Jack Mennie <jackmennie@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Import UP Bank transactions into Actual Budget
 One-shot importer for settled UP transactions. Uses Actual Budget's supported
 Node.js API helper and runs periodically from cron.